<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>접영 on 아쿠아크루</title><link>https://aquacrew.kr/tags/%EC%A0%91%EC%98%81/</link><description>Recent content in 접영 on 아쿠아크루</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://aquacrew.kr/tags/%EC%A0%91%EC%98%81/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2026-09-13 코칭훈련</title><link>https://aquacrew.kr/p/2026-09-13-%EC%BD%94%EC%B9%AD%ED%9B%88%EB%A0%A8/</link><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aquacrew.kr/p/2026-09-13-%EC%BD%94%EC%B9%AD%ED%9B%88%EB%A0%A8/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="-코칭훈련-2026-09-13"&gt;🏊‍♂️ 코칭훈련 (2026-09-13)
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-훈련-요약표"&gt;📊 훈련 요약표
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
